<title>INDIA: India's UTI money market fund NAV 10.0146 rupees.</title>
<headline>India's UTI money market fund NAV 10.0146 rupees.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-run mutual fund Unit Trust of India (UTI) said on Wednesday the net asset value of its money market mutual fund was 10.0146 rupees on April 29.</p>
<p>This NAV implies a daily compounded annualised growth rate of 9.285 percent per annum from the date of launch of scheme (April 23, 1997) till Tuesday, it said.</p>
<p>UTI said it would be releasing its NAV every day.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
